  "description": "The Debug build of SdlVulkan.Renderer, for Debug consumers that need the debug inspector and the #if DEBUG types (DebugInspector, DebugInspectorOptions, GpuFaultInjection), which the Release SdlVulkan.Renderer package does not contain. Same version as SdlVulkan.Renderer. Reference SdlVulkan.Renderer when the configuration is not Debug and SdlVulkan.Renderer.Debug when it is, with a Configuration-conditioned PackageReference; Visual Studio needs a restore after switching configuration.",
